#: includes/class-segurium-iid.php:256
msgid ""
"Segurium detected this site was moved or cloned and is re-establishing its "
"secure connection in the background. If you have a Pro license, please re-"
"activate it on the Segurium account screen so Pro features are restored on "
"the new identity."
msgstr ""
"Segurium zistilo, že táto webová stránka bola presunutá alebo naklonovaná, a"
" na pozadí znova nadväzuje zabezpečené pripojenie. Ak máte licenciu Pro, "
"znova ju aktivujte na obrazovke účtu Segurium, aby sa funkcie Pro obnovili "
"aj pod novou identitou."

#: includes/class-segurium-iid.php:315
msgid ""
"Segurium could not activate the Pro license on this site because it is "
"currently bound to another installation. Please open the Segurium account "
"portal on the original installation and deactivate the license there; the "
"binding will be released and Pro features will re-activate here on the next "
"license check."
msgstr ""
"Segurium nemohlo aktivovať licenciu Pro na tejto webovej stránke, pretože je"
" momentálne viazaná na inú inštaláciu. Otvorte portál účtu Segurium v "
"pôvodnej inštalácii a licenciu tam deaktivujte; väzba sa uvoľní a funkcie "
"Pro sa tu znova aktivujú pri ďalšej kontrole licencie."

#: includes/class-segurium-info-shield.php:333
msgid ""
"On Nginx, the Server header must be removed at the server level "
"(server_tokens off;). This toggle has no effect."
msgstr ""
"Na Nginx sa hlavička Server musí odstrániť na úrovni servera (server_tokens "
"off;). Tento prepínač nemá žiadny účinok."

#: includes/class-segurium-info-shield.php:336
msgid ""
"On Apache with FastCGI, the Server header is added after PHP runs. Use "
"ServerTokens Prod in Apache config."
msgstr ""
"Na Apache s FastCGI sa hlavička Server pridáva až po spustení PHP. V "
"konfigurácii Apache použite ServerTokens Prod."

#: includes/class-segurium-info-shield.php:340
msgid ""
"On IIS, use the removeServerHeader attribute in web.config. This toggle has "
"limited effect."
msgstr ""
"Na IIS použite atribút removeServerHeader vo web.config. Tento prepínač má "
"obmedzený účinok."

#: includes/class-segurium-info-shield.php:354
msgid ""
"Your server uses FastCGI, which may re-add the X-Powered-By header. Verify "
"removal by inspecting response headers."
msgstr ""
"Váš server používa FastCGI, ktoré môže hlavičku X-Powered-By znova pridať. "
"Odstránenie overte kontrolou hlavičiek odpovede."

#: includes/class-segurium-info-shield.php:367
msgid ""
"Jetpack is active and requires XML-RPC. Disabling XML-RPC will break the "
"Jetpack connection."
msgstr ""
"Jetpack je aktívny a vyžaduje XML-RPC. Vypnutie XML-RPC preruší pripojenie "
"Jetpacku."

