msgid "Request failed"
msgstr "Požiadavka zlyhala"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1100
msgid "Your session has expired. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr ""
"Platnosť vašej relácie vypršala. Znova načítajte stránku a skúste to znova."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1102 includes/class-segurium.php:3710
msgid "Segurium Cloud consent is required before scanning."
msgstr "Pred skenovaním je potrebný súhlas so Segurium Cloud."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1103
msgid "The scan could not be initialized. Check the PHP error log."
msgstr ""
"Skenovanie sa nepodarilo inicializovať. Skontrolujte protokol chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1104
msgid ""
"The scan started but the background worker could not be dispatched. Try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Skenovanie sa spustilo, ale proces na pozadí sa nepodarilo spustiť. Skúste "
"to znova."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1105
msgid ""
"The scan could not be started due to a server error. Check the PHP error "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Skenovanie sa pre chybu servera nepodarilo spustiť. Skontrolujte protokol "
"chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1106
msgid ""
"Could not fetch scan status due to a server error. Check the PHP error log."
msgstr ""
"Stav skenovania sa pre chybu servera nepodarilo načítať. Skontrolujte "
"protokol chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1107
msgid ""
"Could not stop the running scan due to a server error. Check the PHP error "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Prebiehajúce skenovanie sa pre chybu servera nepodarilo zastaviť. "
"Skontrolujte protokol chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1108
msgid "The server returned an error while processing the request."
msgstr "Server pri spracovaní požiadavky vrátil chybu."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1109
msgid "Network error — the request could not reach the server."
msgstr "Chyba siete – požiadavka sa nedostala na server."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1110
msgid ""
"The progress display hit a script error and stopped updating. Reload the "
"page to see the current state — the scan itself is unaffected. Details are "
"in the browser console."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazenie priebehu narazilo na chybu skriptu a prestalo sa aktualizovať. "
"Znova načítajte stránku a uvidíte aktuálny stav – samotné skenovanie to "
"neovplyvnilo. Podrobnosti sú v konzole prehliadača."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1111
msgid ""
"The server returned an unexpected response. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr ""
"Server vrátil neočakávanú odpoveď. Znova načítajte stránku a skúste to "
"znova."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1112
msgid ""
"Segurium got an empty response from the server. The PHP handler likely "
"crashed before producing any output — check the PHP error log for a fatal, "
"OOM, or timeout."
msgstr ""
"Segurium dostalo zo servera prázdnu odpoveď. Obsluha PHP pravdepodobne "
"spadla skôr, ako čokoľvek vypísala – v protokole chýb PHP hľadajte fatálnu "
"chybu, nedostatok pamäte (OOM) alebo vypršanie časového limitu."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1113
msgid ""
"Segurium's response markers are missing from the body. The Segurium AJAX "
"handler did not run, or another plugin replaced the entire response. Check "
"wp-content/mu-plugins, active plugins, and the PHP error log."
msgstr ""
"V tele odpovede chýbajú značky Segurium. Obsluha AJAX Segurium sa nespustila"
" alebo iný plugin nahradil celú odpoveď. Skontrolujte wp-content/mu-plugins,"
" aktívne pluginy a protokol chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1114
msgid ""
"Segurium's response was cut off mid-stream — the start marker arrived but "
"the end marker did not. The PHP handler crashed mid-response (fatal, OOM, or"
" timeout). Check the PHP error log."
msgstr ""
"Odpoveď Segurium bola uprostred prerušená – prišla počiatočná značka, ale "
"nie koncová. Obsluha PHP spadla počas odpovede (fatálna chyba, OOM alebo "
"vypršanie časového limitu). Skontrolujte protokol chýb PHP."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1115
msgid ""
"Segurium could not unwrap the server response. Check the PHP error log for a"
" fatal, OOM, or timeout in the Segurium handler."
msgstr ""
"Segurium nedokázalo rozbaliť odpoveď servera. V protokole chýb PHP hľadajte "
"fatálnu chybu, OOM alebo vypršanie časového limitu v obsluhe Segurium."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:1116
msgid ""
"Segurium received a response wrapped in valid markers but the JSON inside "
"did not parse. This usually indicates a fatal PHP error inside the Segurium "
"handler — check the PHP error log."
msgstr ""
